{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-south-living","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"south-living-dubai-south-dubai-south","about":"South Living, an exclusive and ambitious project from developer Dubai South, offers a place to live in a developer-designed city of the future. Buyers and investors can choose from a variety of apartments with beautiful views of the surrounding area, ensuring a comfortable stay for everyone. South Living includes studios with one, two or three bedrooms.South Living is not just an apartment complex, it is a city of the future, designed for happy and empowered people. It is an inclusive and cohesive community with a strong focus on environmental stewardship and a philosophy of mindful consumption of natural resources.Southern Living offers elegant homes for families who appreciate a high level of comfort and style. Living spaces combine modern design with maximum comfort, and community areas designed for enjoyable family time.South Living residents have everything they need for the perfect living experience, including a community park, supermarkets, restaurants and more. Convenient visitor parking and a magnificent double-height lobby with waterfall.South Living is located around the world's largest airport, Al Maktoum Airport, and offers residents convenient access to Expo Road, which provides comfortable access to Dubai's iconic destinations.","price":1042525,"title":"South Living","bitrix":{"id":629,"pf_id":"are.2.14060","source":null,"project_id":"South Living","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"South Living","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Dubai South","project_location":"Dubai South (Dubai World Central)"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1705/images/2024/04/24/340x252/DYNLXMH3h3TLWV8AJf2r5di070Z0w9JuSadbiRTW.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1705/images/2024/04